"Specify pages by using their paths. Enter one path per line. The '*' "
"character is a wildcard. An example path is %user-wildcard for every "
"user page. %front is the front page."
msgstr ""
"پاتھز استعمال کر کے صفحات مخصوص کریں۔ "
